cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, cite the LoCoMo paper and this package."
title: "LoCoMo-200 — Long-Term Conversational Memory Benchmark"
abstract: "A filtered, text-verifiable 200-question subset of LoCoMo (ACL 2024) for evaluating long-horizon conversational memory of AI agents end-to-end, with a runner and a strict semantic judge."
